      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 10,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "社長 need not use any honorifics to make DC to do something for him. If DC wants 社長 to do that, it's a different story.DCから社長に頼んで弁護士に手紙を送って頂くようにしたい would be okay.",
      "html": "社長 need not use any honorifics to make DC to do something for him. If DC wants 社長 to do that, it's a different story.DCから社長に頼んで弁護士に手紙を送って頂くようにしたい would be okay.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "f48e42ec5bbd464de2d0e16293e90a400636f1aa30f0c9b88cfe2be20a16d6df",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 11,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "no, that phrase was DC asking the President what he wanted him to do. ie DC talking to the Prez.",
      "html": "no, that phrase was DC asking the President what he wanted him to do. ie DC talking to the Prez.",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "8adc813f72bd3556ef3e8d5b6100ddf05e1cdc77a333ad6e571534e482b530eb",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 12,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "In that case, you have to use 貰いたい.",
      "html": "In that case, you have to use 貰いたい.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "2067a0943be4d1e0bedccb3dde4ef67ff83449fc017411b25a90be251dacc196",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 13,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "This is level one? I don't believe it.",
      "html": "This is level one? I don't believe it.",
      "credits_raw": "bab",
      "content_sha256": "6af9c30c5f86820890e52dea6026ffdd4726f537fe60f72d6e22e467c5ec5b91",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 14,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "bab Please suggest what you think the level is if you don't think this is not the level one.",
      "html": "bab Please suggest what you think the level is if you don't think this is not the level one.",
      "credits_raw": "Miki",
      "content_sha256": "a91bc4a65f189f67eae8d2a6b8a2ff7944a8431171f36f6ce8dcf4210fd705ab",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 15,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "致す／致しますis not the opposite of 頂く。Instead, it is a humble form of する。",
      "html": "致す／致しますis not the opposite of 頂く。Instead, it is a humble form of する。",
